2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506567 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:230 *** Spec comments: ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506576 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:231 ***   1. Cell A with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506585 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:232 ***   2. Cell B with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506594 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:233 ***   3. In cell A the timing advance = TSPX_y3 (=20) ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506603 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:234 ***   4. non-synch, rot=1, nci=0, handover reference = TSPX_HoRefB ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506612 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:235 ==========================================================
